      <div class="eyebrow">Our Story</div>
      <h1>Making space for what matters</h1>
      <p class="lede">We believe technology should serve humans, not the other way around.</p>
      <p>In a world where digital tools often dictate the pace and shape of work, we help organisations reclaim control. Our approach puts people back in the driver's seat, using technology as an enabler of purpose, not a source of overwhelm. By simplifying systems and redesigning work from the inside out, we empower teams to make conscious choices about how they work, collaborate, and thrive.</p>
      <p>Simplify Co. exists to help organisations cut through complexity and fatigue so work becomes clearer, more joyful and more impactful. We believe transformation works best when it is led from within, so we equip individuals and teams with the organisation design capability they need to shape change with confidence.</p>

